{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":5156,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":3,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":311358,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1595151,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":207201,"Name":"Tlseege","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-207201.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1331755758,"LastPoster":{"Id":272881,"Name":"mckievme","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272881.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":8,"Preview":{"Id":1892060,"PostDate":1428341971,"PostContent":"Anyone have the laundry service price list? We are going 2 weeks with our 2 kids....trying to fig...","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Jamie","Email":"lovinmylilone@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.192.94.81","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1400754382,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Nybride525","Id":278074,"Name":"Nybride525","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"209.163.219.226","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"5eebd64edb3b5f21257385548aa2f424","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;past brides - how did you pick the songs for the guitarist to play? &amp;nbsp;Carla sent me the list but I&#039;m completely unfamiliar with the names of classic music. &amp;nbsp;any good recommendations? &amp;nbsp;i&#039;m having a hard enough time with the songs for the reception!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891789,"PostDate":1428074514,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>past brides - how did you pick the songs for the guitarist to play? \u00a0Carla sent me the list but I'm completely unfamiliar with the names of classic music. \u00a0any good recommendations? \u00a0i'm having a hard enough time with the songs for the reception!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"howard.tracyann@gmail.com","IpAddress":"209.163.219.226","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1399396256,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277868.jpg?_r=1400085061","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"tracyannhoward","Id":277868,"Name":"tracyannhoward","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.237.123.18","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"1a7ca07a98852628062526bc3a7f9180","RawContent":"I am not sure how long the construction will last. I will ask for you and let you know. I am sitting on my balcony and just took a picture of it. It looks like they are almost done. We are on preferred side,  and there is the same construction at the other side as well but not close to the rooms. \n\nThe preferred pool is amazing (adults only). If you want to sit at the other pool you need to get there at 7am and put down a towel and a peice of clothing or sunglasses or something to keep that spot. Otherwise gooooood luck. \n\nCheck in for preferred only took about 20 mins. our guests don&#039;t arrive until next Wedneaday and they are staying on the other side so I will let you know how the check in goes for them. And as far as time share people, we saw a few at the airport and they didn&#039;t bother us and so far not one single person has brought up or came up to us about time shares here.","Attachments":[],"Id":1891791,"PostDate":1428081601,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I am not sure how long the construction will last. I will ask for you and let you know. I am sitting on my balcony and just took a picture of it. It looks like they are almost done. We are on preferred side,  and there is the same construction at the other side as well but not close to the rooms. <br>\nThe preferred pool is amazing (adults only). If you want to sit at the other pool you need to get there at 7am and put down a towel and a peice of clothing or sunglasses or something to keep that spot. Otherwise gooooood luck. <br>\nCheck in for preferred only took about 20 mins. our guests don't arrive until next Wedneaday and they are staying on the other side so I will let you know how the check in goes for them. And as far as time share people, we saw a few at the airport and they didn't bother us and so far not one single person has brought up or came up to us about time shares here.\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kylie537@gmail.com","IpAddress":"205.206.138.179","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1418395709,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"kylie537","Id":281397,"Name":"kylie537","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.196.104.150","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":false,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"682d32928b198301a36c9c6f0ba4dcca","RawContent":"[quote name=\"BrittR\" post=\"1891714\" timestamp=\"1428004873\"]\nI just got my final contract from Pilar.\nWe have hired an outside photographer.\nI was told we had to pay $150 vendor fee for the photographer and $150 vendor fee for the photographer assistant.\nThe resort is also trying to charge me for a $65 day pass for the photographer and assistant, is this correct as it sounds like they are double dipping to me?[\/quote]Hello! I emailed Pilar a couple weeks ago letting her know we are having an outside photographer and she also quoted me on those prices. I didn&#039;t see anything about the $65 on the contract but who knows. Not going to lie, when we first read \"$150\/person\" my fiance and I thought they meant per guest...and we almost had a heart attack. Haha. Still a bummer with the extra fees but I feel like it&#039;s only the beginning...\n\nAnybody opt out of the cocktail hour? I was all for having a cocktail hour at the mix bar until my fiance found out how much it would cost us per person. As of now we are not having a cocktail hour and going to tell the guests to head to the lobby bar while we take single and group pictures. We just couldn&#039;t wrap our heads around spending that much for a cocktail hour when it was an all-inclusive and they can just walk to the lobby bar and drink for free? But I also don&#039;t want our guests to miss out.","Attachments":[],"Id":1891898,"PostDate":1428246062,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>BrittR, on 02 April 2015 - 03:01 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I just got my final contract from Pilar.<\/p>\n<p>We have hired an outside photographer.<\/p>\n<p>I\u00a0was told we had to pay $150 vendor fee for the photographer and $150 vendor fee for the photographer assistant.<\/p>\n<p>The resort is also trying to charge me for a $65 day pass for the photographer and assistant, is this correct as it sounds like they are double dipping to me?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Hello! I emailed Pilar a couple weeks ago letting her know we are having an outside photographer and she also quoted me on those prices. I didn't see anything about the $65 on the contract but who knows. Not going to lie, when we first read \"$150\/person\" my fiance and I thought they meant per guest...and we almost had a heart attack. Haha. Still a bummer with the extra fees but I feel like it's only the beginning...<\/p><br \/><p>Anybody opt out of the cocktail hour? I was all for having a cocktail hour at the mix bar until my fiance found out how much it would cost us per person. As of now we are not having a cocktail hour and going to tell the guests to head to the lobby bar while we take single and group pictures. We just couldn't wrap our heads around spending that much for a cocktail hour when it was an all-inclusive and they can just walk to the lobby bar and drink for free? But I also don't want our guests to miss out.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kaylahrt@gmail.com","IpAddress":"206.196.104.150","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1428245015,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"valleyhart16","Id":282639,"Name":"valleyhart16","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.199.68.105","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3bd6a6f3f6403dabbf6ca70856a07402","RawContent":"Anyone have the laundry service price list? We are going 2 weeks with our 2 kids....trying to figure out if it&#039;s cheaper to get laundry done there and pack less or if I really need 2 weeks worth of clothes each plus backups lol....we have to pay for all luggage on our airline and since we r bringing a bunch of wedding crap with us I&#039;d rather not bring 14 pairs shorts for each kid when they all look almost the same lol","Attachments":[],"Id":1892060,"PostDate":1428341971,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Anyone have the laundry service price list? We are going 2 weeks with our 2 kids....trying to figure out if it's cheaper to get laundry done there and pack less or if I really need 2 weeks worth of clothes each plus backups lol....we have to pay for all luggage on our airline and since we r bringing a bunch of wedding crap with us I'd rather not bring 14 pairs shorts for each kid when they all look almost the same lol\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>Jamie","Email":"lovinmylilone@yahoo.com","IpAddress":"70.192.94.81","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1400754382,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Nybride525","Id":278074,"Name":"Nybride525","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"70.72.41.59","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"59a85fc0f8b5a3ff9dab841b833f1dde","RawContent":"[quote name=\"Nybride525\" post=\"1892060\" timestamp=\"1428359971\"]\nAnyone have the laundry service price list? We are going 2 weeks with our 2 kids....trying to figure out if it&#039;s cheaper to get laundry done there and pack less or if I really need 2 weeks worth of clothes each plus backups lol....we have to pay for all luggage on our airline and since we r bringing a bunch of wedding crap with us I&#039;d rather not bring 14 pairs shorts for each kid when they all look almost the same lol[\/quote]I can&#039;t speak for your resort but just travelled with kids. Mine needed way more shirts than shorts.  For 7 days they did ok work 2-3 maybe 4 shorts but god they needed 14 shirts! Good luck. \n\nYou can probably email the resort for this info as well.  \n\n\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk","Attachments":[],"Id":1892106,"PostDate":1428357291,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Nybride525, on Today, 05:39 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>Anyone have the laundry service price list? We are going 2 weeks with our 2 kids....trying to figure out if it's cheaper to get laundry done there and pack less or if I really need 2 weeks worth of clothes each plus backups lol....we have to pay for all luggage on our airline and since we r bringing a bunch of wedding crap with us I'd rather not bring 14 pairs shorts for each kid when they all look almost the same lol<\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nI can't speak for your resort but just travelled with kids. Mine needed way more shirts than shorts.  For 7 days they did ok work 2-3 maybe 4 shorts but god they needed 14 shirts! Good luck. <br><br>\nYou can probably email the resort for this info as well.  <br><br><br>\nSent from my iPhone using Tapatalk\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p>-Kim<\/p>\n<p>Married on 2015\/01\/21 at the Grand Sirenis Riviera Maya with 43 guests in attendance \u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Planning Thread -\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Pictures\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78209-calgarybride2015s-planning-thread-15121-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya\/page-36<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Wedding Review\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/38741-grand-sirenis-riviera-maya-brides\/page-131#entry1885600<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0","Email":"kdeakin@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"68.145.235.0","GroupId":42,"GroupName":"Sr. Member","JoinDate":1399410602,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277873.jpg?_r=1422218225","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"calgarybride2015","Id":277873,"Name":"calgarybride2015","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.176.115.246","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":66415,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4919071549395b26553cb6f10548dc4e","RawContent":"[quote name=\"BrittR\" post=\"1891714\" timestamp=\"1428004873\"]\nI just got my final contract from Pilar.\nWe have hired an outside photographer.\nI was told we had to pay $150 vendor fee for the photographer and $150 vendor fee for the photographer assistant.\nThe resort is also trying to charge me for a $65 day pass for the photographer and assistant, is this correct as it sounds like they are double dipping to me?[\/quote]\nThey&#039;ve got a new policy where you pay $150 outside vendor fee for photography in addition to a day pass that is $65 per person (for example we are having 2 photographers and an assistant so we are having to pay for 3 day passes). As far as I know, you should only get charged $150 one time and then get charged per person for the $65 day pass.\n\nIt used to be that there was no outside vendor fee for photography what this has recently changed. Even though I was able to show proof that I was told in the beginning that there was no outside photography vendor fee (old emails from Isela), it was difficult for them to remove this from our itemized list. I wouldn&#039;t be surprised if I have to argue about this when I get down there for the wedding.","Attachments":[],"Id":1892113,"PostDate":1428359505,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>BrittR, on 02 April 2015 - 03:01 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>I just got my final contract from Pilar.<\/p>\n<p>We have hired an outside photographer.<\/p>\n<p>I\u00a0was told we had to pay $150 vendor fee for the photographer and $150 vendor fee for the photographer assistant.<\/p>\n<p>The resort is also trying to charge me for a $65 day pass for the photographer and assistant, is this correct as it sounds like they are double dipping to me?<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>They've got a new policy where you pay $150 outside vendor fee for photography in addition to a day pass that is $65 per person (for example we are having 2 photographers and an assistant so we are having to pay for 3 day passes). As far as I know, you should only get charged $150 one time and then get charged per person for the $65 day pass.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>It used to be that there was no outside vendor fee for photography what this has recently changed. Even though I was able to show proof that I was told in the beginning that there was no outside photography vendor fee (old emails from Isela), it was difficult for them to remove this from our itemized list. I wouldn't be surprised if I have to argue about this when I get down there for the wedding.<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mckiever.whetsel@gmail.com","IpAddress":"68.53.109.189","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1377354014,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-272881.jpg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":180,"PhotoHeight":180,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"mckievme","Id":272881,"Name":"mckievme","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"66415","Title":"OFFICIAL NOW Jade Wedding Thread","LastPostDate":1428359505},"Pages":{"TotalItems":5156,"TotalPages":516,"CurrentPage":5150,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":5140,"LastPage":5150},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
