{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":9,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":false,"Views":243,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1891555,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":282603,"Name":"Kimmie2016","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"StartDate":1427886241,"LastPoster":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":14,"Preview":{"Id":1891555,"PostDate":1427886241,"PostContent":"Hi! I am a new 2016 Bride and we are getting married in Mexico. We are really looking at the Drea...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimber897@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.115.77.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427885635,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kimmie2016","Id":282603,"Name":"Kimmie2016","IsOnline":false}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"98.115.77.10","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79011,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9bb2d9ea43ce545bc651cd81d8b1fba6","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi! I am a new 2016 Bride and we are getting married in Mexico. We are really looking at the Dreams resort. Does anyone have personal experience or insight to this resort? I want to get the most bang for my buck. Iberostar Cancun&amp;nbsp;was our second choice. I also like La Esmeralda because of the beautiful swim up suites but they are VERY pricy.  Anybody  have any suggestions for this budget conscious bride?&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Thanks&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Kim&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891555,"PostDate":1427886241,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi! I am a new 2016 Bride and we are getting married in Mexico. We are really looking at the Dreams resort. Does anyone have personal experience or insight to this resort? I want to get the most bang for my buck. Iberostar Cancun\u00a0was our second choice. I also like La Esmeralda because of the beautiful swim up suites but they are VERY pricy.\u00a0\u00a0Anybody\u00a0\u00a0have any suggestions for this budget conscious bride?<\/p>\n<p>Thanks<\/p>\n<p>Kim<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kimber897@gmail.com","IpAddress":"98.115.77.10","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1427885635,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Kimmie2016","Id":282603,"Name":"Kimmie2016","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79011,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"87068577364de64ae37c0ff28bd0570c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Kimmie,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Welcome to BDW! &amp;nbsp;Which Dreams? &amp;nbsp;We love them! &amp;nbsp;AMResorts offer some of the best wedding amenities.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I actually do not like the swim ups at La Esmeralda. &amp;nbsp;I think there are better ones out there. I find the placement of the swimups not great. &amp;nbsp;very little privacy.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Karisma hotels have much better swim ups. &amp;nbsp;I love the ones at Generations. &amp;nbsp;That is where I will be in a couple of weeks.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Also Dreams Tulum has some new swim ups.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you want, you can fill out the link in my signature and we can break down the pros and cons of each hotel brand. &amp;nbsp;We are also running a &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/&#039;&gt;bride and groom fly free promo&lt;\/a&gt; and &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78993-amresorts-ready-to-wed-promotion-2015-500-towards-wedding\/&#039;&gt;Dreams is running $500 off your wedding promo&lt;\/a&gt; and &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78991-karisma-free-unlimited-private-events-promotion\/&#039;&gt;Karisma is offering an unlimited FREE events promo&lt;\/a&gt; right now.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891558,"PostDate":1427887755,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Kimmie,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Welcome to BDW! \u00a0Which Dreams? \u00a0We love them! \u00a0AMResorts offer some of the best wedding amenities.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I actually do not like the swim ups at La Esmeralda. \u00a0I think there are better ones out there. I find the placement of the swimups not great. \u00a0very little privacy.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Karisma hotels have much better swim ups. \u00a0I love the ones at Generations. \u00a0That is where I will be in a couple of weeks.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Also Dreams Tulum has some new swim ups.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you want, you can fill out the link in my signature and we can break down the pros and cons of each hotel brand. \u00a0We are also running a <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>bride and groom fly free promo<\/a> and <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78993-amresorts-ready-to-wed-promotion-2015-500-towards-wedding\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Dreams is running $500 off your wedding promo<\/a> and <a href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78991-karisma-free-unlimited-private-events-promotion\/' class='bbc_url' title=''>Karisma is offering an unlimited FREE events promo<\/a> right now.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Founder and Owner of BestDestinationWedding.com \u00a0\/ \u00a0<\/span><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78931-bride-and-groom-fly-free-20152016\/'><strong><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Bride & Groom Fly FREE Promotion<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/wrighttravelagency.com\/inquiry\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">Looking for a travel agency that specializes in Destination Weddings<\/span><\/a><\/strong><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>?<\/strong> \u00a0We are an award winning travel agency and you can <\/span><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/p\/21494-wright-travel-agency-destination-wedding-and-honeymoon-specialists\/'><span style=\"color:#008080;\">read our reviews\u00a0here.<\/span><\/a><\/strong><\/span><br>\n\u00a0<br><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><strong>Awards and recognition:\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Palace Resorts PRO Platinum Agency (Top Award) \u00a0 \u00a0 | \u00a0 \u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">AMResorts Master Agent & Top Agency \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Karisma Hotels Diamond Level 5 (highest production), Top 10 Azul Weddings, Top Wedding Coordinator | <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/68050-karisma-hotels-givc-and-gi-wedding-consultants-wright-travel-agency\/'><strong>Wright Travel & Karisma GIVC Benefits<\/strong><\/a><\/span><\/span><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Travel Impressions Best of the Best Globe Winner \u00a0 \u00a0| \u00a0 \u00a0\u00a0<\/span><\/span><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\">Apple Vacations Golden Apple Winner \u00a0<\/span><\/span><br><img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\" alt=\"gallery_206696_17572_8409.jpg\"> \u00a0 \u00a0<img src=\"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/gallery\/album_17572\/sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\" alt=\"sml_gallery_206696_17572_1003.jpg\"><br><span style=\"color:#008080;\"><span style=\"font-family:arial, helvetica, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><strong><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/t\/921\/vendor-business-membership-fees-rules-updated-6-18-2010'>Vendor rules are HERE! Please read!<\/a>\u00a0\u00a0<\/strong><\/span><\/span><\/span><strong><span style=\"color:#b22222;\">If you are a vendor and looking to advertise your business,<\/span>\u00a0please email\u00a0<a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:ads@bestdestinationwedding.com?subject=Advertising%20on%20BestDestinationWedding.com'>ads@bestdestinationwedding.com<\/a>.<\/strong>","Email":"admin@bestdestinationwedding.com","IpAddress":"71.202.225.11","GroupId":4,"GroupName":"Administrators","JoinDate":1137206220,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-206696.jpg?_r=1386394555","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":135,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"TammyWright","Id":206696,"Name":"TammyWright","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"189.182.21.127","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79011,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"4c4b379582912de9c350e39926748314","RawContent":"[size=3][font=tahoma][color=#282828]Hi @[member=\"Kimmie2016\"]\n\nCongratulations on your engagement!!\n\nI would like to welcome you to the best destination wedding site, where you will find lots of information regarding wedding venue locations, details, etc...\n\nIf you&#039;d like to you can visit our website www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com and check out our wedding packages, we have a beautiful private beach called Las Caletas in Puerto Vallarta, Mexico, where we make the magic happen with an amazing view and an awesome setting for your ceremony.\n\nIf you want to speak with a sales agent for further assistance feel free to contact us at toll free 1.866.731.8152 or e-mail us to info@adventureweddingsvallarta.com[\/color][\/font][\/size]\n[quote name=\"Kimmie2016\" post=\"1891555\" timestamp=\"1427904241\"]\nHi! I am a new 2016 Bride and we are getting married in Mexico. We are really looking at the Dreams resort. Does anyone have personal experience or insight to this resort? I want to get the most bang for my buck. Iberostar Cancun was our second choice. I also like La Esmeralda because of the beautiful swim up suites but they are VERY pricy.  Anybody  have any suggestions for this budget conscious bride?\nThanks\nKim[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1891563,"PostDate":1427889423,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p><span  style=\"font-size:12px\"><span  style=\"font-family:tahoma, geneva, sans-serif\"><span  style=\"color:#282828\">Hi @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"282603\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/index.phpuser\/282603-kimmie2016\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Kimmie2016<\/span><\/a><br><br>\nCongratulations on your engagement!!<br><br>\nI would like to welcome you to the best destination wedding site, where you will find lots of information regarding wedding venue locations, details, etc...<br><br>\nIf you'd like to you can visit our website\u00a0www.adventureweddingsvallarta.com\u00a0and check out our wedding packages, we have a beautiful private beach called Las Caletas in Puerto Vallarta, Mexico, where we make the magic happen with an amazing view and an awesome setting for your ceremony.<br><br>\nIf you want to speak with a sales agent for further assistance feel free to contact us at toll free 1.866.731.8152 or e-mail us to info@adventureweddingsvallarta.com<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Kimmie2016, on 01 April 2015 - 11:04 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi! I am a new 2016 Bride and we are getting married in Mexico. We are really looking at the Dreams resort. Does anyone have personal experience or insight to this resort? I want to get the most bang for my buck. Iberostar Cancun\u00a0was our second choice. I also like La Esmeralda because of the beautiful swim up suites but they are VERY pricy.\u00a0\u00a0Anybody\u00a0\u00a0have any suggestions for this budget conscious bride?<\/p>\n<p>Thanks<\/p>\n<p>Kim<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"dennise@adventureweddingsvallarta.com","IpAddress":"187.146.166.254","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1343040803,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258213.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":100,"PhotoHeight":100,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"LasCaletas","Id":258213,"Name":"LasCaletas","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79011,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e256b2000548d05712b12c27026e6977","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the forum!!&amp;nbsp; How exciting.&amp;nbsp; I am a budget savvy bride and I chose the Grand sunset princess hotel in the mayan Riviera.&amp;nbsp; I loved the hotel, we have been there twice before.&amp;nbsp; The prices for our guests were quite reasonable especially for the type of resort that&amp;nbsp; is.&amp;nbsp; It&#039;s so beautiful.&amp;nbsp; We are happy with our wedding packages too.&amp;nbsp; ;)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891565,"PostDate":1427890625,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the forum!!\u00a0 How exciting.\u00a0 I am a budget savvy bride and I chose the Grand sunset princess hotel in the mayan Riviera.\u00a0 I loved the hotel, we have been there twice before.\u00a0 The prices for our guests were quite reasonable especially for the type of resort that\u00a0 is.\u00a0 It's so beautiful.\u00a0 We are happy with our wedding packages too.\u00a0 <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wink.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=';)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"rebecca.valero@gmail.com","IpAddress":"38.112.94.76","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1396964852,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-277519.jpg?_r=1424798460","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":267,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"veryvalentine","Id":277519,"Name":"veryvalentine","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79011,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55359e1be7f6c71e5ecc99bf2a06db7c","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome and congratulations!! We originally were going to get married at Dreams Riviera Cancun, however when we saw what travel was going to be for our guests (approx $2400 per guest), we decided it wasn&#039;t realistic. They also charge an arm and a leg for the smallest things (like $7 for one tea light...?? come on..)\n\n\nWe wanted to be more budget friendly, so we are going with the Riu chain now - much cheaper, it&#039;s still a 4.5 star and I&#039;ve heard nothing but good things :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891568,"PostDate":1427891507,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome and congratulations!! We originally were going to get married at Dreams Riviera Cancun, however when we saw what travel was going to be for our guests (approx $2400 per guest), we decided it wasn't realistic. They also charge an arm and a leg for the smallest things (like $7 for one tea light...?? come on..)<br><br>\nWe wanted to be more budget friendly, so we are going with the Riu chain now - much cheaper, it's still a 4.5 star and I've heard nothing but good things <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"katie_mcbride48@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"199.85.228.129","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424096250,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282132.jpg?_r=1428430872","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"KatieMcBride","Id":282132,"Name":"KatieMcBride","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"71.114.107.100","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79011,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1427915975,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"55f52df24fbcc8e346f8388eba222346","RawContent":"Hi Kimmie, Congrats!\nIf you&#039;re doing Mexico, have you considered The Karisma Resorts?  I can&#039;t speak to the ones you mention below, but we have our wedding at El Dorado Royale\/Casitas in October 2015 and when we visited in November 2014, we were beyond thrilled.  Great bang for your buck too!  \n\nGood luck!\n[quote name=\"Kimmie2016\" post=\"1891555\" timestamp=\"1427904241\"]\nHi! I am a new 2016 Bride and we are getting married in Mexico. We are really looking at the Dreams resort. Does anyone have personal experience or insight to this resort? I want to get the most bang for my buck. Iberostar Cancun was our second choice. I also like La Esmeralda because of the beautiful swim up suites but they are VERY pricy.  Anybody  have any suggestions for this budget conscious bride?\nThanks\nKim[\/quote]","Attachments":[],"Id":1891579,"PostDate":1427893930,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Kimmie, Congrats!<\/p>\n<p>If you're doing Mexico, have you considered The Karisma Resorts? \u00a0I can't speak to the ones you mention below, but we have our wedding at El Dorado Royale\/Casitas in October 2015 and when we visited in November 2014, we were beyond thrilled. \u00a0Great bang for your buck too! \u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>Kimmie2016, on 01 April 2015 - 11:04 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>Hi! I am a new 2016 Bride and we are getting married in Mexico. We are really looking at the Dreams resort. Does anyone have personal experience or insight to this resort? I want to get the most bang for my buck. Iberostar Cancun\u00a0was our second choice. I also like La Esmeralda because of the beautiful swim up suites but they are VERY pricy.\u00a0\u00a0Anybody\u00a0\u00a0have any suggestions for this budget conscious bride?<\/p>\n<p>Thanks<\/p>\n<p>Kim<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><span style=\"color:#000080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">Cheers ~<\/span><\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><span style=\"color:#000080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\"><span style=\"font-family:'lucida sans unicode', 'lucida grande', sans-serif;\">Erica Bazow-To-Be<\/span><\/span><\/span> <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/wub.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':wub:' \/>","Email":"eselek@gmail.com","IpAddress":"71.114.107.100","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1424978322,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-282263.jpg?_r=1424997199","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"ericalbazow1023","Id":282263,"Name":"ericalbazow1023","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79011,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"6b863dc8e9f58eccfaec057f2bc84a65","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the forum and congrats! You will find a lot of useful information here! Dreams properties are very nice. I know a few friends who have been and really enjoyed it :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891585,"PostDate":1427895995,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the forum and congrats! You will find a lot of useful information here! Dreams properties are very nice. I know a few friends who have been and really enjoyed it <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div><br><div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<div>\u00a0<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<p><span style=\"color:#808080;\"><span style=\"font-size:14px;\">My planning thread :<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631'>http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/topic\/78755-perianjay-planning-thread-december-15-2015-beach-palace\/#entry1885631<\/a>","Email":"perianjohnson@gmail.com","IpAddress":"66.241.131.23","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1419419814,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-281478.jpg?_r=1428347017","PhotoWidth":169,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"perianjay","Id":281478,"Name":"perianjay","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"187.175.124.66","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79011,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"9b363217b5833995b9ab021edfc59142","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Welcome to the forum, Kim and Congrats on your dw next year!!! you&#039;ll find tons of great advice and info here to help with your planning decisions.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Here are a few visual \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at several Mayan Riviera resorts - to help inspire you and show you a few options.....enjoy!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152626430674487.1073741908.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Generations Riviera Maya Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-lax.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/10629544_10152626432674487_7077082552283136288_o.jpg\" alt=\"10629544_10152626432674487_7077082552283\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;....or this one from the &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152641474894487.1073741910.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Dreams Tulum Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10511392_10152641478034487_3469697475172755239_o.jpg\" alt=\"10511392_10152641478034487_3469697475172\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;...and this one from &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152516859384487.1073741901.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;The Royal Playa del Carmen Wedding Album:&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/scontent-lax.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10515077_10152516862019487_6164790735209284073_o.jpg\" alt=\"10515077_10152516862019487_6164790735209\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Enjoy your research, and memorable journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891617,"PostDate":1427912959,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Welcome to the forum, Kim and Congrats on your dw next year!!! you'll find tons of great advice and info here to help with your planning decisions.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Here are a few visual \"moments that matter\" Linc captured at several Mayan Riviera resorts - to help inspire you and show you a few options.....enjoy!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...from the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152626430674487.1073741908.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Generations Riviera Maya Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-lax.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/10629544_10152626432674487_7077082552283136288_o.jpg\" alt=\"10629544_10152626432674487_7077082552283\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>....or this one from the <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152641474894487.1073741910.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Dreams Tulum Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-b-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10511392_10152641478034487_3469697475172755239_o.jpg\" alt=\"10511392_10152641478034487_3469697475172\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>...and this one from <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152516859384487.1073741901.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>The Royal Playa del Carmen Wedding Album:<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/scontent-lax.xx.fbcdn.net\/hphotos-xfp1\/t31.0-8\/10515077_10152516862019487_6164790735209284073_o.jpg\" alt=\"10515077_10152516862019487_6164790735209\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Enjoy your research, and memorable journey ahead - cheers!!! team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.231.97.33","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":79011,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"94e7fa295b2a401de998dd01d0b12668","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats on your engagement and welcome to the site! As you can see, everyone is more than willing to pass along tips and ideas as well as suggestions to help you out on your planning journey. Definitely take Tammy up on her offer to help you out with pros and cons. A TA is the best person to get you kick started on what you want, what you want for your guests and what will all work with your budget.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Good luck and happy planning!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1891656,"PostDate":1427927567,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats on your engagement and welcome to the site! As you can see, everyone is more than willing to pass along tips and ideas as well as suggestions to help you out on your planning journey. Definitely take Tammy up on her offer to help you out with pros and cons. A TA is the best person to get you kick started on what you want, what you want for your guests and what will all work with your budget.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Good luck and happy planning!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"79011","Title":"Total Newbie","LastPostDate":1427927567},"Pages":{"TotalItems":9,"TotalPages":1,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":-1,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":0},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
