Request Time: 1 seconds
{"Success":true,"Data":{"State":"open","OpenTime":0,"CloseTime":0,"IsApproved":true,"IsPinned":false,"IsDeleted":false,"IsHidden":false,"IsArchived":false,"IsFollowing":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanReply":true,"CanFollow":true,"TotalPosts":76,"QueuedPosts":0,"DeletedPosts":0,"HasUnreadPosts":true,"HasAttachments":true,"Views":8971,"MovedTo":null,"MovedOn":0,"FirstPostId":1842110,"Rating":0,"RatingHits":0,"Starter":{"Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"IsOnline":true},"StartDate":1396456050,"LastPoster":{"Id":281816,"Name":"maybeoneday","Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"IsOnline":false},"PollState":"0","LastVote":0,"ForumId":2,"Preview":{"Id":1842110,"PostDate":1396456050,"PostContent":"Anyone still looking for a resort for your 2015 wedding? I just found out about a new resort open...","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},"Posts":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":true,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":3,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"3bfccb4a5657f40fc7d152bc8ea102fb","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Anyone still looking for a resort for your 2015 wedding? I just found out about a new resort opening&amp;nbsp;- the Royalton Riviera Cancun! For canadian brides it&#039;s under Sunwing and the few photos I found are gorgeous!! I picked up the new&amp;nbsp;2014\/2015 Sunwing book this morning and found photos of this new resort! It says it&#039;s beachfront, 10 minutes from Cancun airport and 20 minutes to downtown.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;The earliest flight so far that&amp;nbsp;I can find out of Toronto is February 1, 2015. The rates seem quite reasonable and it&#039;s for both families and adults, with a separate adult section.&amp;nbsp;It&#039;s a big resort - 1183 luxury suites, 12 pools, 1 buffet and 8 a la carte restaurants and 14 bars. It also offers the Diamond Club upgrade. Tons of pluses - exclusive DreamBed, Sports Event Guarantee, unlimited reservation free dining at all the a la carte restaurants, 24 hr room service, all-in connectivity featuring free wi-fi throughout the resort, unlimited free in room calling to North America and most of Europe, USB recharge and Bluetooth audio station in your room. Plus it says you can download the free Royalton app to receive the free unlimited free calling plan from your mobile device while on the property as well as unlimited free app to app texting!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;For weddings it says \"sky weddings and wedding gazebos - located on the beach and in the resort&#039;s tranquil garden - offer an unforgettably romantic backdrop for your special day. There is an email: weddingplanner @royaltonresorts.com&amp;nbsp; I checked the website that it lists and had a hard time finding anything specific about this new resort but here is the website since it&#039;s says you can go there and get information on their wedding packages:&amp;nbsp; &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;http:\/\/www.royaltonresorts.com&#039;&gt;www.royaltonresorts.com&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m definitely going to be keeping an eye open for this one since it looks fabulous, even if it&#039;s just for a vacation! I know usually new resorts have bugs and kinks to work out when they first open, so this may only work for someone that is looking at a later 2015 wedding date but I know TripAdvisor will have reviews as soon as&amp;nbsp;the resort actually has guests!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy planning!!&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1842110,"PostDate":1396456050,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Anyone still looking for a resort for your 2015 wedding? I just found out about a new resort opening\u00a0- the Royalton Riviera Cancun! For canadian brides it's under Sunwing and the few photos I found are gorgeous!! I picked up the new\u00a02014\/2015 Sunwing book this morning and found photos of this new resort! It says it's beachfront, 10 minutes from Cancun airport and 20 minutes to downtown.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>The earliest flight so far that\u00a0I can find out of Toronto is February 1, 2015. The rates seem quite reasonable and it's for both families and adults, with a separate adult section.\u00a0It's a big resort - 1183 luxury suites, 12 pools, 1 buffet and 8 a la carte restaurants and 14 bars. It also offers the Diamond Club upgrade. Tons of pluses - exclusive DreamBed, Sports Event Guarantee, unlimited reservation free dining at all the a la carte restaurants, 24 hr room service, all-in connectivity featuring free wi-fi throughout the resort, unlimited free in room calling to North America and most of Europe, USB recharge and Bluetooth audio station in your room. Plus it says you can download the free Royalton app to receive the free unlimited free calling plan from your mobile device while on the property as well as unlimited free app to app texting!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>For weddings it says \"sky weddings and wedding gazebos - located on the beach and in the resort's tranquil garden - offer an unforgettably romantic backdrop for your special day. There is an email: weddingplanner @royaltonresorts.com\u00a0 I checked the website that it lists and had a hard time finding anything specific about this new resort but here is the website since it's says you can go there and get information on their wedding packages:\u00a0 <a href='http:\/\/www.royaltonresorts.com' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>www.royaltonresorts.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>I'm definitely going to be keeping an eye open for this one since it looks fabulous, even if it's just for a vacation! I know usually new resorts have bugs and kinks to work out when they first open, so this may only work for someone that is looking at a later 2015 wedding date but I know TripAdvisor will have reviews as soon as\u00a0the resort actually has guests!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy planning!!<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"75.108.35.133","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7e1446f40470b35e6f7478c4536b0ca0","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Thanks for sharing!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1842133,"PostDate":1396463368,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Thanks for sharing!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"jackielemman86@comcast.net","IpAddress":"70.123.142.233","GroupId":40,"GroupName":"Jr. Member","JoinDate":1379781598,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-273651.jpg?_r=1388803183","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":268,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"jackielemman","Id":273651,"Name":"jackielemman","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"69.126.203.246","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f2003e154d40fcb31ae378af92fe1641","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Oh wow! This resort is gorgeous just saw some pictures. Even the one in DR is pretty amazing. Looks similar in style and class to The Paradisus Palma Real which is the resort we selected for our wedding. I didn&#039;t even know about The Royalton but it looks great!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1842144,"PostDate":1396463994,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Oh wow! This resort is gorgeous just saw some pictures. Even the one in DR is pretty amazing. Looks similar in style and class to The Paradisus Palma Real which is the resort we selected for our wedding. I didn't even know about The Royalton but it looks great!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<div class=\"post-sig post-sig-limit shazam usersig-click\"><div class=\"reparse-sig-lineheight\"><span>Happily married to the love of my life- since July 5, 2013<\/span><\/div><\/div>","Email":"evelynlvazquez@gmail.com","IpAddress":"165.155.200.66","GroupId":3,"GroupName":"Member","JoinDate":1343665762,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-258580.jpeg?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"EVKnowsitall","Id":258580,"Name":"EVKnowsitall","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.245.193.11","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":2,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"a090514877b2f703ba9d8a927c43f97d","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We are booked for our wedding March 2015 so excited!!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858110,"PostDate":1404395049,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We are booked for our wedding March 2015 so excited!!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"monikalaska@live.com","IpAddress":"142.245.193.3","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403100826,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278582.jpg?_r=1405006219","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Monisia","Id":278582,"Name":"Monisia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e1d3ce4425e0bf1cbe0b759b03d5eb67","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Congrats @[member=\"Monisia\"]! You will definitely have to report back and provide a review, with pics of course!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1858126,"PostDate":1404403318,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Congrats @<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278582\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278582-monisia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Monisia<\/span><\/a>! You will definitely have to report back and provide a review, with pics of course!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.71.73.173","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"2dd759e6dd896585494087eebeb5244f","RawContent":"Our travel agent mentioned it to us. The pictures we have see of the future design looks excellent. I wonder what kind of wedding packages they will offer...","Attachments":[],"Id":1859373,"PostDate":1405288495,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Our travel agent mentioned it to us. The pictures we have see of the future design looks excellent. I wonder what kind of wedding packages they will offer...\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mcgillapple@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.53.155.53","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1402260993,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"mariak","Id":278327,"Name":"mariak","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.227.172.254","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dbd427ec0f41946adce32215b47d3558","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Wow this place sounds great! Will definitely consider it!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1860041,"PostDate":1405470316,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Wow this place sounds great! Will definitely consider it!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"maryluong@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"99.227.172.254","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1405265090,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":"none"},"FormattedName":"maredith","Id":278988,"Name":"maredith","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"76.4.33.167","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"b10275a43ab2c737595e7d16869eafe7","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;@[member=\"Monisia\"]&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;My fiance and I are very interested in this resort. Could you share any info on booking the hotel for the wedding? It is a bit difficult to find the accurate info and opening date. Any and all tips would be appreciated! Thanks:)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1864077,"PostDate":1406922610,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>@<a hovercard-ref=\"member\" hovercard-id=\"278582\" data-ipb=\"noparse\" class=\"_hovertrigger url fn name  bbc_member\" href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/user\/278582-monisia\/' title='Member profile'><span itemprop=\"name\">Monisia<\/span><\/a><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>My fiance and I are very interested in this resort. Could you share any info on booking the hotel for the wedding? It is a bit difficult to find the accurate info and opening date. Any and all tips would be appreciated! Thanks:)<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"kristinatalley@gmail.com","IpAddress":"76.4.33.167","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1406922041,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"ktinabond","Id":279260,"Name":"ktinabond","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"142.245.193.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1426025923,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"8cddcb3bab072eef1cc60b12ad75f6ab","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Hi Folks,&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;There is only one provider that contracts that hotel so you cant get it via westjet or aircanada. It is opening in February 2015.&amp;nbsp; Their wedding packages will be similar to the ones listed on royalton hotels website.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;If you have any other questions please let me know.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Monika&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865043,"PostDate":1407415331,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Hi Folks,<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>There is only one provider that contracts that hotel so you cant get it via westjet or aircanada. It is opening in February 2015.\u00a0 Their wedding packages will be similar to the ones listed on royalton hotels website.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>If you have any other questions please let me know.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Monika<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"monikalaska@live.com","IpAddress":"142.245.193.3","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1403100826,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-278582.jpg?_r=1405006219","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"Monisia","Id":278582,"Name":"Monisia","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"dfb67fc4e849222b1e99de0b5fe90f05","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I&#039;m really intrigued by this resort. I&#039;m trying to find out exactly where it is though. I want to be close to Playa del Carmen if I can and I think this resort will be just a little too far for me, and over budget I think too. It looks absolutely beautiful!!&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1865064,"PostDate":1407423308,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I'm really intrigued by this resort. I'm trying to find out exactly where it is though. I want to be close to Playa del Carmen if I can and I think this resort will be just a little too far for me, and over budget I think too. It looks absolutely beautiful!!<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"achadwick9@yahoo.ca","IpAddress":"206.223.185.220","GroupId":38,"GroupName":"Moderators","JoinDate":1283440999,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-232000.jpg?_r=1426134867","PhotoWidth":668,"PhotoHeight":600,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"acw271011","Id":232000,"Name":"acw271011","IsOnline":true}}],"Id":"76750","Title":"New Resort - Royalton Riviera Cancun","LastPostDate":1428221540},"Pages":{"TotalItems":76,"TotalPages":8,"CurrentPage":0,"NextPage":10,"PreviousPage":-1,"LastPage":70},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
