{"Success":true,"Data":[{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.71.74.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ab183e79ae75a9ad22d4020622915a0d","RawContent":"Has anyone received any information about wedding packages for this resort? It looks like it would be a perfect hotel for us but I am nervous to book without knowing the wedding packages.","Attachments":[],"Id":1870331,"PostDate":1409685910,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Has anyone received any information about wedding packages for this resort? It looks like it would be a perfect hotel for us but I am nervous to book without knowing the wedding packages. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mcgillapple@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.53.155.53","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1402260993,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"mariak","Id":278327,"Name":"mariak","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"99.249.5.225","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bca23a790155b64f8c704236993d84ef","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;We booked our wedding here for Sept 2015. &amp;nbsp;I emailed and was told that their wedding packages would be ready around Oct\/Nov of this year. &amp;nbsp;I am somewhat nervous but I was sent the Punta Cana Royalton and the White Sands Royalton packages and they were similar to each other so I am hoping (and assuming) they will be similar to what will be offered at the Royalton Riviera Cancun. &amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1870848,"PostDate":1410083275,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>We booked our wedding here for Sept 2015. \u00a0I emailed and was told that their wedding packages would be ready around Oct\/Nov of this year. \u00a0I am somewhat nervous but I was sent the Punta Cana Royalton and the White Sands Royalton packages and they were similar to each other so I am hoping (and assuming) they will be similar to what will be offered at the Royalton Riviera Cancun. \u00a0<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brooke.turley@impressions-printing.com","IpAddress":"64.140.119.151","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407418897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279352.jpg?_r=1418803924","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"BrookeTurley","Id":279352,"Name":"BrookeTurley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"207.161.204.180","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"f6a12f53204a0fbdfe060989ba474986","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;Here&#039;s another new resort that&#039;s already opened called the Generations Riviera Maya.&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Linc captured a wedding there shown in these magical wedding \"moments that matter\" with more at the album link here: &lt;a data-ipb=&#039;nomediaparse&#039; href=&#039;https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152626430674487.1073741908.18683524486&amp;amp;type=3&#039;&gt;Generations Riviera Maya Wedding Album&lt;\/a&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-g-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/10548040_10152626433689487_474654768007711462_o.jpg\" alt=\"10548040_10152626433689487_4746547680077\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;img src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10506902_10152626435184487_7710500067967194769_o.jpg\" alt=\"10506902_10152626435184487_7710500067967\"&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;Happy research everyone, and All the BEST!!! cheers, team MTM :)&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1870862,"PostDate":1410089297,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>Here's another new resort that's already opened called the Generations Riviera Maya.<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Linc captured a wedding there shown in these magical wedding \"moments that matter\" with more at the album link here: <a href='https:\/\/www.facebook.com\/media\/set\/?set=a.10152626430674487.1073741908.18683524486&type=3' class='bbc_url' title='External link' rel='nofollow external'>Generations Riviera Maya Wedding Album<\/a><\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-g-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xaf1\/t31.0-8\/10548040_10152626433689487_474654768007711462_o.jpg\" alt=\"10548040_10152626433689487_4746547680077\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span rel='lightbox'><img class='bbc_img' src=\"https:\/\/fbcdn-sphotos-f-a.akamaihd.net\/hphotos-ak-xap1\/t31.0-8\/10506902_10152626435184487_7710500067967194769_o.jpg\" alt=\"10506902_10152626435184487_7710500067967\"><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p>Happy research everyone, and All the BEST!!! cheers, team MTM <img src='http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_emoticons\/default\/smile.png' class='bbc_emoticon' alt=':)' \/><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"<p><img src=\"http:\/\/i711.photobucket.com\/albums\/ww116\/momentsthatmatter\/MTMLogo08-1.png\" alt=\"MTMLogo08-1.png\"><\/p>\n<p><a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.momentsthatmatterphotography.com'><strong><span style=\"font-size:18px;\">Moments That Matter Photography Studios, Playa del Carmen, Mexico<\/span><\/strong><\/a><\/p>\n<p>Canadian Award Winning Photojournalist serving Mayan Riviera<br>\nEmail: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='mailto:contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com'>contact@momentsthatmatterphotography.com<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Scoop on what we do:\u00a0 <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/www.bestdestinationwedding.com\/reviews\/r\/4212-beautiful-november-wedding\/#review'>MTM Reviews<\/a><\/p>\n<p>Meet Lincoln & Team MTM: <a data-ipb='nomediaparse' href='http:\/\/vimeo.com\/51032621'>\"Meet Lincoln\" Video + see his Passion!!!<\/a>","Email":"momentsthatmatterphotography@gmail.com","IpAddress":"189.221.252.187","GroupId":49,"GroupName":"Insiders","JoinDate":1280192660,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-230711.png?_r=0","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":134,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"Moments That Matter","Id":230711,"Name":"Moments That Matter","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.71.74.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"fb652b6627fd79bc8423c59ea5b761c7","RawContent":"[quote name=\"BrookeTurley\" post=\"1870848\" timestamp=\"1410101275\"]\nWe booked our wedding here for Sept 2015.  I emailed and was told that their wedding packages would be ready around Oct\/Nov of this year.  I am somewhat nervous but I was sent the Punta Cana Royalton and the White Sands Royalton packages and they were similar to each other so I am hoping (and assuming) they will be similar to what will be offered at the Royalton Riviera Cancun.\n[\/quote]Congrats!! Very exciting!! We are still finalizing our decision. Had you been looking at other hotels in Mexico? I just read on TripAdvisor that you can see the Royalton under construction on Google World. I checked. It&#039;s pretty cool!","Attachments":[],"Id":1870957,"PostDate":1410120834,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>BrookeTurley, on 07 September 2014 - 09:47 AM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'><p>We booked our wedding here for Sept 2015. \u00a0I emailed and was told that their wedding packages would be ready around Oct\/Nov of this year. \u00a0I am somewhat nervous but I was sent the Punta Cana Royalton and the White Sands Royalton packages and they were similar to each other so I am hoping (and assuming) they will be similar to what will be offered at the Royalton Riviera Cancun.<br><\/p><\/div><\/div>\n<br>\nCongrats!! Very exciting!! We are still finalizing our decision. Had you been looking at other hotels in Mexico? I just read on TripAdvisor that you can see the Royalton under construction on Google World. I checked. It's pretty cool!\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mcgillapple@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.53.155.53","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1402260993,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"mariak","Id":278327,"Name":"mariak","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"108.168.0.215","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"e0a8c687b2c57849268dfd44bed216be","RawContent":"Thank you you as well. When are you planning your wedding for?  I did quite a bit of research on resorts in Mexico and I really liked the moon palace but it was slightly higher than what we wanted our guests to pay to stay the week so we kept looking. I have been keeping an eye on the prices of the royalton and although they don&#039;t have the rates for sept 2015 up yet on any of the sites I think that the rate pp that we got will be very good in comparison. I know my sister and brother in law went to the Royalton in Cuba only a couple of months after it opened and they said it was one of the nicest resorts they&#039;ve ever been to so that helped to make my decision to book at a resort that isn&#039;t even open yet easier! Where else have you looked in Mexico?","Attachments":[],"Id":1870984,"PostDate":1410156915,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                Thank you you as well. When are you planning your wedding for?  I did quite a bit of research on resorts in Mexico and I really liked the moon palace but it was slightly higher than what we wanted our guests to pay to stay the week so we kept looking. I have been keeping an eye on the prices of the royalton and although they don't have the rates for sept 2015 up yet on any of the sites I think that the rate pp that we got will be very good in comparison. I know my sister and brother in law went to the Royalton in Cuba only a couple of months after it opened and they said it was one of the nicest resorts they've ever been to so that helped to make my decision to book at a resort that isn't even open yet easier! Where else have you looked in Mexico? \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brooke.turley@impressions-printing.com","IpAddress":"64.140.119.151","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407418897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279352.jpg?_r=1418803924","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"BrookeTurley","Id":279352,"Name":"BrookeTurley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"67.71.74.153","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":1,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"30ba2c742ad91a39eec246151266175e","RawContent":"I have been obsessing over the Royalton for the past few weeks. Originally we were looking at Jamaica but it&#039;s less expensive in Mexico and the resort looks like it will be amazing!!!! I was super excited and ready to book and then one of my friends who works on a cruise ship told me that the beach in the area isnt amazing. She was saying that the beach has a lot of seaweed and potentially rocks. I really wanted the beautiful turquoise water of the Caribbean. SOOO now I am second guessing my choice and thinking of going with a Riu Palace hotel but I find the number of RIU hotels overwhelming. I was looking at the Moon Palace today to see reviews of the beach, since it&#039;s next door, and the reviews of the hotel are amazing! The food looks incredible. All that said, the reviews of Royalton hotels are amazing. We are planning for the second week in August. I never thought that organizing a destination wedding would be so nerve-racking.","Attachments":[],"Id":1871043,"PostDate":1410207020,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                I have been obsessing over the Royalton for the past few weeks. Originally we were looking at Jamaica but it's less expensive in Mexico and the resort looks like it will be amazing!!!! I was super excited and ready to book and then one of my friends who works on a cruise ship told me that the beach in the area isnt amazing. She was saying that the beach has a lot of seaweed and potentially rocks. I really wanted the beautiful turquoise water of the Caribbean. SOOO now I am second guessing my choice and thinking of going with a Riu Palace hotel but I find the number of RIU hotels overwhelming. I was looking at the Moon Palace today to see reviews of the beach, since it's next door, and the reviews of the hotel are amazing! The food looks incredible. All that said, the reviews of Royalton hotels are amazing. We are planning for the second week in August. I never thought that organizing a destination wedding would be so nerve-racking. \r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"mcgillapple@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"70.53.155.53","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1402260993,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"mariak","Id":278327,"Name":"mariak","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"162.201.183.74","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"bbe398b69fbbdd7ce61c47a0218dedec","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My agent was able to pull some pretty reasonable rates. &amp;nbsp;My attraction lies in that it will be a new facility. &amp;nbsp;Planning my wedding Oct 2015. &amp;nbsp;Can&#039;t wait to hear the reviews.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1874798,"PostDate":1412789456,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My agent was able to pull some pretty reasonable rates. \u00a0My attraction lies in that it will be a new facility. \u00a0Planning my wedding Oct 2015. \u00a0Can't wait to hear the reviews.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"n.m.dunigan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.201.183.74","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412789275,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280394.jpg?_r=1412807769","PhotoWidth":158,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"daconqueror","Id":280394,"Name":"daconqueror","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"64.140.119.151","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"7da1e75ed81eaa0857d0fafb0f97c137","RawContent":"[quote name=\"daconqueror\" post=\"1874798\" timestamp=\"1412807456\"]\nMy agent was able to pull some pretty reasonable rates.  My attraction lies in that it will be a new facility.  Planning my wedding Oct 2015.  Can&#039;t wait to hear the reviews.[\/quote]Congratulations! Were you about to get many photos or much information about the resort from your travel agent?  I have been searching around since we booked for more information or progress and haven&#039;t been able to find a lot.  I did find the facebook page of the architect building the resort and a couple of pictures of the progress but not much else.","Attachments":[],"Id":1875131,"PostDate":1412951615,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p class='citation' style='color:#324F85;margin:15px;font-weight:bold;font-style:italic;'>daconqueror, on 08 October 2014 - 05:30 PM, said:<\/p><div class='blockquote'><div class='quote'>\n<div>\n<p>My agent was able to pull some pretty reasonable rates. \u00a0My attraction lies in that it will be a new facility. \u00a0Planning my wedding Oct 2015. \u00a0Can't wait to hear the reviews.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<\/div><\/div>\n<p>Congratulations! Were you about to get many photos or much information about the resort from your travel agent? \u00a0I have been searching around since we booked for more information or progress and haven't been able to find a lot. \u00a0I did find the facebook page of the architect building the resort and a couple of pictures of the progress but not much else. \u00a0<\/p>\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"brooke.turley@impressions-printing.com","IpAddress":"64.140.119.151","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1407418897,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-279352.jpg?_r=1418803924","PhotoWidth":200,"PhotoHeight":200,"PhotoType":"facebook"},"FormattedName":"BrookeTurley","Id":279352,"Name":"BrookeTurley","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"206.205.117.10","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":1412953602,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"25b273b5311f8178ee3832547786981b","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;I have not been able to find any photos. &amp;nbsp;I e-mailed back and forth with a Christine from the Royalton about wedding packages. &amp;nbsp;The packages won&#039;t be advertised until November\/December. &amp;nbsp;She was able to tell me if my date was available and the price to reserve it. &amp;nbsp;I copied a bit of the e-mail and pasted it below:&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#1f497d;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria, serif;\"&gt;\"Thank you for your email and interest in Royalton Riviera Cancun!&amp;nbsp; Unfortunately at this time we do not have any wedding details available. With this being said, we do ask for your patience as we work on finalizing all the wedding details over the next few months. We will have these sent to you as soon as possible, but realistically, this will be around the end of November\/December 2014.&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;\/p&gt;\n&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=\"color:#1f497d;\"&gt;&lt;span style=\"font-family:cambria, serif;\"&gt;We are however accepting wedding bookings currently as the hotel is still subject to open in January 2015. We would not start the wedding planning until after the time the wedding details are all available. As soon as we have the finalized wedding packages and their pricing, I will send this to you.\"&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/span&gt;&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1875135,"PostDate":1412953587,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>I have not been able to find any photos. \u00a0I e-mailed back and forth with a Christine from the Royalton about wedding packages. \u00a0The packages won't be advertised until November\/December. \u00a0She was able to tell me if my date was available and the price to reserve it. \u00a0I copied a bit of the e-mail and pasted it below:<\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#1f497d\"><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">\"Thank you for your email and interest in Royalton Riviera Cancun!\u00a0 Unfortunately at this time we do not have any wedding details available. With this being said, we do ask for your patience as we work on finalizing all the wedding details over the next few months. We will have these sent to you as soon as possible, but realistically, this will be around the end of November\/December 2014.<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n<p>\u00a0<\/p>\n<p><span  style=\"color:#1f497d\"><span  style=\"font-family:cambria, serif\">We are however accepting wedding bookings currently as the hotel is still subject to open in January 2015. We would not start the wedding planning until after the time the wedding details are all available. As soon as we have the finalized wedding packages and their pricing, I will send this to you.\"<\/span><\/span><\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"n.m.dunigan@gmail.com","IpAddress":"162.201.183.74","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1412789275,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":true,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/cdn\/profile\/photo-280394.jpg?_r=1412807769","PhotoWidth":158,"PhotoHeight":300,"PhotoType":"custom"},"FormattedName":"daconqueror","Id":280394,"Name":"daconqueror","IsOnline":false}},{"Title":null,"ShowSignature":true,"ShowEmoticons":true,"IpAddress":"184.149.9.52","IsFirstPost":false,"IsQueued":false,"IsVisible":true,"IsDeleted":false,"CanEdit":false,"CanDelete":false,"CanLike":true,"TopicId":76750,"EditedBy":"","EditDate":0,"EditReason":"","DeleteDate":0,"TotalLikes":0,"IsLiked":false,"PostKey":"ac451d1360d40538fa5c587b211168ac","RawContent":"&lt;p&gt;My fianc\u00e9 and I have decided to get married at this resort in January 2015. They have already&amp;nbsp;sent information on their wedding packages and they confirmed that the resort is opening on December 17, 2014. Wedding details have not yet been confirmed, but I will be sure to&amp;nbsp;post my experiences&amp;nbsp;as we go through the process.&lt;\/p&gt;","Attachments":[],"Id":1876291,"PostDate":1413809666,"PostContent":"            <html>\r\n              <head>\r\n                <style type=\"\"text\/css\"\">\r\n                  body {\r\n                    font-size: 16px;\r\n                    font-family: Helvetica, Verdana;\r\n                  }\r\n                  img .bbc_img {\r\n                    width: 100%;\r\n                  }\r\n                <\/style>\r\n              <\/head>\r\n              <body>\r\n                <p>My fianc\u00e9 and I have decided to get married at this resort in January 2015. They have already\u00a0sent information on their wedding packages and they confirmed that the resort is opening on December 17, 2014. Wedding details have not yet been confirmed, but I will be sure to\u00a0post my experiences\u00a0as we go through the process.<\/p>\n\r\n              <\/body>\r\n            <\/html>","Author":{"Signature":"","Email":"candyhobson@hotmail.com","IpAddress":"184.149.9.52","GroupId":39,"GroupName":"Newbie","JoinDate":1413809171,"Photo":{"HasPhoto":false,"PhotoUrl":"http:\/\/bdw.stevewright.netdna-cdn.com\/public\/style_images\/destination\/profile\/default_large.png","PhotoWidth":125,"PhotoHeight":125,"PhotoType":""},"FormattedName":"Sweetbonbon","Id":280740,"Name":"Sweetbonbon","IsOnline":false}}],"Pages":{"TotalItems":76,"TotalPages":8,"CurrentPage":10,"NextPage":20,"PreviousPage":0,"LastPage":70},"PushNotifications":[{"Key":"notifications","Value":0,"Type":"int"},{"Key":"messages","Value":0,"Type":"int"}]}
